      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NYMBAL NZ (5) continues to race well having placed in both outings since he led for a win at this venue last month. Had strong form against the good three-year-olds over the Brisbane carnival, highlighted by a Redcliffe Derby win and Queensland Derby fourth. He looks suited up to a distance where he won his lone attempt. TOMAHAWK BART (7) has been racing well in higher-graded races including a Penrith win two back. Draws wide but has the early speed to be prominent. NOVANTA RISING (9) found winning form two back at Wagga before coming from the back line to miss narrowly last start at Goulburn. Draws wide but he is going well. JANIE BLU (6) draws wider than in the last-start second but that was her third placing here on the trot and she is two-time winner at this longer distance. MAURLEN BOY (4) didn't miss by much here last week and draws lower.",
